========================================================================
8. MEDICAL AND COMPLIANCE DISCLAIMER
========================================================================

NoLoop is intended to support medical claims processing and related
administrative workflows. It is not intended to provide medical advice, make
independent clinical decisions, or replace professional review.

All claim adjudication decisions require human review and approval by
authorized personnel at the relevant insurance company or TPA. The AI
components of NoLoop are designed to assist, not replace, human judgment.

Users are responsible for:

- Validating system outputs before operational or clinical reliance
- Protecting patient and business data in accordance with HIPAA, NHCX,
  and applicable Indian healthcare regulations
- Ensuring compliance with applicable laws, regulations, and contractual
  obligations, including privacy and healthcare requirements where relevant

